# No parent-dir exclusions needed — this folder is the project root
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store

# Workshop CONCEPTS stay local — half-finished explorations, one-off mockups.
_redesign/m3/_*
_redesign/m3/mockups/
_redesign/m3/*.mjs

# ...but the DESIGN SYSTEM itself SHIPS. It documents the components every live
# surface is built from, and a design system nobody can open is a design system
# nobody follows — which is exactly how the first-run screen kept three layers of
# card tub after every other surface had moved to editorial. Reachable at
#   /_redesign/m3/design-system.html   (catalogue, tokens, every component)
#   /_redesign/m3/specimen.html?id=<id> (one component, full page)
#   /_redesign/m3/row-showcase.html     (the row family)
# These carry demo fixtures only — no customer data.
